#: includes/Abilities/Schedule/GetMissedSchedules.php:27
msgid "Get Missed Schedules"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Abilities/Schedule/GetMissedSchedules.php:28
msgid "List posts whose scheduled publish time has already passed but are still waiting in the future queue — the \"missed schedule\" failure. Includes how late each one is and whether WP-Cron looks healthy."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Abilities/Schedule/ListDraftPosts.php:27
msgid "List Draft Posts"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Abilities/Schedule/ListDraftPosts.php:28
