#: includes/Abilities/Schedule/ReschedulePost.php:28
msgid "Reschedule a Post"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Abilities/Schedule/ReschedulePost.php:29
msgid "Move a scheduled post to a new date and time, or set the date of a draft or pending post (it stays unpublished; use schedule-post to queue it). Give either an absolute publish_at, or a relative shift such as \"+3 days\" or \"-2 hours\". Times are site-local unless an offset is supplied. While AI posting to social media is blocked, sharing is turned off for a scheduled post it moves and the response says so."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Abilities/Schedule/ReschedulePost.php:110
msgid "Provide exactly one of publish_at (absolute) or shift (relative)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Abilities/Schedule/ReschedulePost.php:172
#: includes/Abilities/Schedule/SchedulePost.php:154
msgid "Social sharing was turned off for this post because AI posting to social media is blocked in SchedulePress > AI (MCP). Turn sharing back on in the post editor if it should be shared when it goes live."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Abilities/Schedule/ReschedulePost.php:206
msgid "That post has no usable publish date to shift from."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Abilities/Schedule/ReschedulePost.php:215
msgid "Could not apply that shift to the post's current publish time."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Abilities/Schedule/SchedulePost.php:27
msgid "Schedule a Post"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Abilities/Schedule/SchedulePost.php:28
msgid "Schedule an existing draft or pending post to publish at a given date and time. The time is interpreted in the site timezone unless the value carries an explicit offset. A post that is already scheduled is moved to the new time (reschedule-post does the same and also takes a relative shift). When it goes live the post is shared to social media by its own share settings; while AI posting to social media is blocked, sharing is turned off for the post and the response says so."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Abilities/Schedule/SchedulePost.php:107
msgid "That post is in the trash. Restore it before scheduling."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Abilities/Schedule/UnschedulePost.php:26
msgid "Unschedule a Post"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Abilities/Schedule/UnschedulePost.php:27
